  "description": "If two heads are better than one, then three wheels are definitely better than two. This electric trike is the ultimate three-wheeled machine: it’s got a powerful 500W motor with rear-wheel drive for better traction, hydraulic disc brakes for stopping with precision, parking brake for hanging back to load up, and a high-volume cargo basket to haul everything you want to bring along for the ride. Boca Rev’s new limited-edition design commemorates the Grateful Dead’s 60th anniversary and embodies the band’s adventurous spirit with their iconic Steal Your Face logo, dancing bears, and 13-point lightning bolt decorating the frame and seat. Enjoy seemingly endless cruising under the sun with a high range of up to 49 miles per charge, and stay comfortable the whole time thanks to a Super Comfort seat with supportive backrest, wide tires for bump-free riding, and Pedal Assist with cadence sensor for smooth speed boosts. Just one ride on Boca Rev and you’ll agree – the third wheel’s the charm.",
